        "description": "🔴 **PLAY FRIDAY TO SUNDAY ONLY**🔴\n\nPlay **Battlegrounds** for FREE! We're developing a multiplayer medieval sandbox with fun physics and fast-paced movement. Use weapons, grappling hooks, bombs, catapults, and more! Fight your friends, siege forts, and create your own fun.\n\n{1093104585888834}\n\n✅ **Features:**\n- Physics-based weapons and movement\n- Grappling hooks, rocket/jetpack, and other wrist-mounted gadgets\n- Different types of bombs\n- Cannons\n- And more!\n\n⚔️ **In Development:**\n- Customizable characters and armour\n- Weapon shop\n- Clan system\n- Bigger servers\n- Bigger maps\n\nThousands are already in combat — join us to help create the best medieval sandbox in VR! Are you ready to carve out your own legacy on the battlegrounds?\n\n 😊 Community Discord: **www.discord.gg/bgvr**",
